WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Now it is time to put everything we have learned into practice.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:09.000
On the screen, you will see a video titled Songs to Help You Remember the Proper BPM.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.000
As you watch, I want you to evaluate the compressions you see.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Look closely at the depth, the rate, and the recoil.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:20.000
You might notice that some students in the video perform a bit better than others,

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.000
and that is exactly why we practice.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Pump, pump, pump, pump, to the CPR

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Pump, pump, pump, pump, to the CPR

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Pump, pump, pump, pump, to the CPR

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Pump, pump, pump, pump, to the CPR

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:44.000
If there's someone down with no breath

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Pump it, just keep them from death

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Pump, pump, pump, pump, to the CPR

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:58.000
Pump, pump, pump, pump, to the CPR

00:00:58.000 --> 00:00:59.000
Pump, pump

